  "body": "Whether you're searching for your first home, a comfortable downsize or a smart investment in a sound position, this one deserves your attention. Our owner's next chapter is secured.\r\nThe largest of only 2, this 140sqm (approx.) unit feels and looks more like a  house.  Standing proud, right next door to Milford Primary School this home has been freshened up and presents well, with 2 oversized bedrooms and a rumpus room, one bathroom across two levels. Nothing to do here except move in.\r\nEmbracing the original 1960s polished native timber floors it has a welcoming feel offering a practical layout. Open-plan living flows from gorgeous new kitchen to dining room and living space.  North facing to ensure gorgeous, sunny days, elevated front living room and generous spaces where you can spread out. While the private backyard adds even more space to enjoy,  kick a ball, put up a trampoline or let the dog play.\r\nRevel in this neighbourhood with this hard to beat location, well set back from the road, mere minutes to retail therapy in Milford village and fabulous mall.   Linger over a flat white at your favourite cafes, or finish the day with sand between your toes at Milford Beach. When life calls you further afield, the motorway, Busway station, Smales Farm and North Shore Hospital are all within easy reach. Families will love the zoning for Milford Primary, TNIS, and both Westlake Boys' and Westlake Girls' High Schools. For peace of mind, this property was NOT affected by any of the severe weather events in 2023. \r\n\r\nFEATURES YOU'LL LOVE; \r\n* A sunny end position: north-facing, with beautiful natural light. \r\n* Room to spread out: three double bedrooms, one bathroom and a flexible layout over two levels.\r\n * Outdoor options:  generous private back yard.\r\n * Comfort now, potential ahead: freshened up and very liveable, with room to add your own style and value. \r\n* Parking sorted: deep single garage with internal access, and additional off-street parking for 3 cars or a boat or RV.\r\n * Prime location: a short walk to Milford Mall, cafes & restaurants, and Milford Beach, North Shore Hospital and so much more.\r\n* Excellent School Zones: Milford Primary, TNIS, and both Westlake Boys' and Girls' High Schools.   \r\n\r\n Now it's your opportunity to claim yours.  Come for the sunshine, see the potential and make your move! Conjunctional offers welcome.\r\n\r\nSet Date of Sale 15 December @4pm (unless sold prior)",
